source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: With a space after the closer the pair inside the bold is its token's last run, so Jira breaks in both tokens and jiro reads a hard break inside the bold and another after it.
-- input.jira --
*x\\y* -z\\w
-- rendered.html --
<p><b>x<br class="atl-forced-newline" />y</b> -z<br class="atl-forced-newline" />w</p>
-- want.md --
**x\
y** -z\
w
-- warnings.json --
[]
